//SYSIN    DD DUMMY
//*
//MEMB     EXEC PGM=IEBGENER
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSUT1   DD *
LAB09 MEMBER SELTWO
THIS MEMBER WILL ALSO BE USED FOR SELECT TESTING
/*
//SYSUT2   DD DSN=IBMUSER.JCLLAB07.PDS(SELTWO),DISP=SHR
//SYSIN    DD DUMMY
//*
//MEMC     EXEC PGM=IEBGENER
//SYSPRINT DD SYSOUT=*
//SYSUT1   DD *
LAB09 MEMBER EXCLTEST
THIS MEMBER WILL BE USED FOR EXCLUDE TESTING
/*
